{{ja-kanjitab|くすり|yomi=k}}

From {{inh|ja|jpx-pro|*kusori}}. Appears to be the {{m|ja|連用形|tr=ren'yōkei||continuative or noun form}} of unattested verb ''kusuru'' “to have a mystical effect”.

